<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At the conclusion of each meeting, the recording will be available in the <a href="https://live.myvrspot.com/index.php/showcase/view-showcase?sid=fNzZhNDhmMTkzNzVjNjBlODEzMDczYTUyYWU2NmMzZjc" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Video Archive</a>.</p>
