What would Prop A mean for homeowners? Check out our tax impact calculator at elections.leanderisd.org.

📢 Election Day: Polls will be open on Nov. 3 from 7 a.m. to 7 p.m. You can vote at any voting site in the county in which you reside. To find a polling location near you, visit elections.leanderisd.org." aria-hidden="true">
