			<span class="sbi-screenreader">All six of our high school marching bands are head</span>
									<img decoding="async" src="https://www.leanderisd.org/wp-content/uploads/sb-instagram-feed-images/878274310_18602461909065632_648808714382499349_nfull.webp" alt="All six of our high school marching bands are headed to state! 🥁

