			<span class="sbi-screenreader">One more day until Election Day! ✅ Great job, Huds</span>
			<svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-clone fa-w-16 sbi_lightbox_carousel_icon" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Clone" data-fa-proƒcessed="" data-prefix="far" data-icon="clone" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512">
                    <path fill="currentColor" d="M464 0H144c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v48H48c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v320c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h320c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48v-48h48c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V48c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM362 464H54a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V150a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h42v224c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h224v42a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm96-96H150a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V54a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h308a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v308a6 6 0 0 1-6 6z"></path>
                </svg>						<img decoding="async" src="https://www.leanderisd.org/wp-content/uploads/sb-instagram-feed-images/881396674_18602345347065632_5477217105118989302_nfull.webp" alt="One more day until Election Day! ✅ Great job, Hudson, over at River Place Elementary for being one of the winners of @traviscountyclerk’s I Voted sticker contest. 👏 

River Place Elementary art teacher Ms. Schexnayder helped and inspired her students to submit their artwork by “encouraging them to be creative and use their own ideas to draw their designs,” she explains. “I hope students see that their creativity and ideas have a place beyond the classroom and can make a meaningful impact in their community. Having a student’s artwork selected for an I Voted sticker shows them that art has the power to bring people together, tell a story and be part of something bigger.” 💙

You can get Hudson’s sticker tomorrow on Election Day at River Place Elementary School. 🗳️" aria-hidden="true">
