		</div><div id="nav_menu-29" class="widget-odd widget-3 et_pb_widget widget_nav_menu"><h4 class="widgettitle">Additional Resources</h4><div class="menu-board-of-trustees-container"><ul id="menu-board-of-trustees" class="menu"><li class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-8630"><a target="_blank" href="https://meetings.boardbook.org/Public/Organization/795" data-ps2id-api="true">Board Meeting Agendas</a></li>
<li class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-152664"><a target="_blank" href="https://news.leanderisd.org/category/homepage/board-briefs/" data-ps2id-api="true">Board Briefs</a></li>
<li class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-8629"><a target="_blank" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/13Y3LR6I-0On5B02s-AvAI3bcCJm_AB38/view" data-ps2id-api="true">Board Operating Procedures</a></li>
<li class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-8628"><a target="_blank" href="https://pol.tasb.org/home/index/1248" data-ps2id-api="true">Policy Governance</a></li>
<li class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-163062"><a target="_blank" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/15aHNz-79ax0LffDk_26bHVPzNb1kj8eN/view?usp=drive_link" data-ps2id-api="true">Board Members Continuing Education Annual Report</a></li>
</ul></div></div><div id="rss-81" class="widget-even widget-4 et_pb_widget widget_rss"><h4 class="widgettitle"><a class="rsswidget rss-widget-feed" href="https://www.leanderisd.org/category/support+boardoftrustees/feed/"><img class="rss-widget-icon" style="border:0" width="14" height="14" src="https://www.leanderisd.org/wp-includes/images/rss.png" alt="RSS feed: Support" loading="lazy" /></a> <a class="rsswidget rss-widget-title" href="https://www.leanderisd.org/">Support</a></h4><ul><li><a class='rsswidget' href='https://www.leanderisd.org/runningfortheleanderisdschoolboardfaqs/'>Running for the Leander ISD School Board FAQs</a><div class="rssSummary">How many members are on the Leander ISD School Board and how long do they serve? The Board consists of seven members serving terms of four years, with elections held on the November uniform election date in even numbered years. The terms of half of the Board members, or as near to half as possible, [&hellip;]</div></li><li><a class='rsswidget' href='https://www.leanderisd.org/electionreminderforstaff/'>Election Reminder for Staff</a><div class="rssSummary">As election season approaches, it is a good time to remind everyone that school district employees are prohibited from using district resources to advocate for or against a particular candidate, party, or measure. District resources include our mail/email systems, as well as campus/classroom/teacher websites and social media accounts. Employees are free to support any political [&hellip;]</div></li><li><a class='rsswidget' href='https://www.leanderisd.org/boardrecognitions/'>Board Recognitions</a><div class="rssSummary">Leander ISD takes great pride in highlighting our students, teachers and staff for their accomplishments throughout the school year. One way the district does so is by honoring them at an LISD Board of Trustees meeting. The criteria for recognition may vary occasionally, but the district tries hard to maintain a standard that is fair [&hellip;]</div></li></ul></div><div id="rss-82" class="widget-odd widget-last widget-5 et_pb_widget widget_rss"><h4 class="widgettitle"><a class="rsswidget rss-widget-feed" href="https://news.leanderisd.org/tag/board/feed/atom/"><img class="rss-widget-icon" style="border:0" width="14" height="14" src="https://www.leanderisd.org/wp-includes/images/rss.png" alt="RSS feed: News" loading="lazy" /></a> <a class="rsswidget rss-widget-title" href="https://news.leanderisd.org/">News</a></h4><ul><li><a class='rsswidget' href='https://news.leanderisd.org/board-briefs-oct-29-2026/'>Board Briefs: Oct. 29, 2026</a> <span class="rss-date">October 31, 2026</span><div class="rssSummary">During its Oct. 29 meeting, the Board of Trustees agenda included: * Annual Demographic Report Highlights Stabilizing Overall Enrollment, Shifting Growth * Board Begins Work on 2027–31 Strategic Plan * Board Approves Targeted Improvement Plans for 3 Elementary Schools</div></li><li><a class='rsswidget' href='https://news.leanderisd.org/board-briefs-oct-15-2026/'>Board Briefs: Oct. 15, 2026</a> <span class="rss-date">October 16, 2026</span><div class="rssSummary">During its Oct. 15 meeting, the Board of Trustees agenda included: * Spotlight on Learning: Wiley MS Students Put Mathematical Thinking Into Practice * Board Reviews Math Progress, Areas for Continued Growth * Global Languages Update Highlights Growth, Student Progress * Budget Pressures Grow as LISD Increases Employee Healthcare Investment</div></li><li><a class='rsswidget' href='https://news.leanderisd.org/board-briefs-oct-1-2026/'>Board Briefs: Oct. 1, 2026</a> <span class="rss-date">October 4, 2026</span><div class="rssSummary">During its Oct. 1 meeting, the Board of Trustees agenda included: * Facility Updates: New Hope HS, Early College HS and Elementary Schools #31 &amp; #32 * Spotlight on Learning: Hisle Elementary * Board Reviews New Family Engagement Framework</div></li></ul></div></div>

		</div> <!-- #content-area -->
